/.raptor/
/target/
/dist/

# Date-stamped session-transcript dumps must never be committed: they can leak
# verbatim internal notes (deny-list, prompt-defense) into the tracked tree.
# No legitimate root doc starts with a digit, so this only catches those dumps.
/[0-9]*.md
/[0-9]*.txt

# Claude Code tool-local settings and workflow worktrees; never tracked.
/.claude/
